<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates widen.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates widen.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound widened in a liquid private sector market on Thursday to between 9-3/4 and 10-1/4 from 10-1/8 and 10-1/4 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also widened to 9-7/8 and 10-3/8 from Wednesday's 10-1/8 and 10-1/4 percent, they added.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
